<title>HONG KONG: Credit Commercial sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Credit Commercial sets HK$ fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Commercial de France Hong Kong branch has lodged a HK$50 million fixed rate certificate of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The certificates were priced at par and pay a coupon of 6.83 percent per annum. The issue will mature on September 13, 1999.</p>
<p>Oakreed Financial Services is the arranger.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
